### 동일한 멱등키로 재요청 (중복 처리 방지)
POST {{baseUrl}}/internal/v1/inventories/reserve
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "{{testOrderId4}}",
  "idempotencyKey": "test-idempotency-001",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "{{productId}}",
      "hubId": "{{hubId}}",
      "quantity": 5
